<title>CHINA: Peace Hill changes name to Kong Sun.</title>
<headline>Peace Hill changes name to Kong Sun.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beverages manufacturer and distributor Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd said on Thursday it had changed the company name to Kong Sun Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The stock name of the company's shares will also be changed to Kong Sun with effect from Friday, it said.</p>
<p>Last November, Kong Fa Holding Ltd had made a general offer for Peace Hill shares after it exercised an option to purchase a major stake in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
